#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:1590
msgid "Things you can do with this error."
msgstr "Ce que vous pouvez faire avec cette erreur."

#: opti-behavior/includes/tooltip-helper.php:1597
msgid ""
"The kind of friction: rage click, dead click, error click, or thrashed "
"cursor. An auto-triage verdict (bug / review / visitor) is shown when "
"available."
